Bitwise batch==decode held (decode+batch+grouped changed symmetrically), but
the llama.cpp envelopes breached badly:
  layer-27 max 0.404175 -> 1.23608 (limit 0.55)
  layer-27 rms 0.0347506 -> 0.0454834 (limit 0.045)
  logits  max 0.00976753 -> 0.0177469 (limit 0.013)
